876
01:07:23,194 --> 01:07:26,032
to memorize Qur'an and to study with Rasool Allah ﷺ

877
01:07:26,248 --> 01:07:30,303
and to teach and then they became governors, military generals.

878
01:07:30,628 --> 01:07:36,163
And then they had huge families married to 2, 3, 4 wives.

879
01:07:36,443 --> 01:07:39,287
It was the exception among them to find the Sahabi(صحابي) married to one.

880
01:07:39,814 --> 01:07:40,970
They had many children.

881
01:07:41,317 --> 01:07:43,744
They had to run businesses, they had farms.

882
01:07:44,369 --> 01:07:48,535
I mean, when you look at all of the events that was going on in the life of one Sahabi(صحابي),

883
01:07:49,808 --> 01:07:52,083
there was so much going on, in their lives.

884
01:07:54,073 --> 01:08:00,904
But for example, somebody who is comfortably leading a peaceful life, they're not being challenged

885
01:08:01,138 --> 01:08:07,373
they're not going through hardships, they're not tested to the limit, because the battlefield is the greatest test.

886
01:08:08,315 --> 01:08:11,333
And the Sahabah(صحابه) didn't go through that once they went through it many times

887
01:08:12,211 --> 01:08:14,264
and that brings the best and the worst, out of the person.

888
01:08:15,221 --> 01:08:18,481
That is where they knew, where As-Sadiqeen(الصادقين) were and where the Munafiqeen(منافقين) were.

889
01:08:19,485 --> 01:08:22,506
It wasn't in times of peace, they knew it, in the battlefield.

890
01:08:23,067 --> 01:08:25,642
 That's where Nifaaq(نفاق) would show up.

891
01:08:27,195 --> 01:08:29,890
 Allahعَزّوجَلّ purified that generation.

892
01:08:30,358 --> 01:08:35,514
So that the ones, who were left and were considered among the Sahabah(صحابه) were tested,

893
01:08:35,823 --> 01:08:37,091
they were tested to the limit.

894
01:08:38,176 --> 01:08:43,174
So, Sahabah(صحابه) whom Rasool Allah ﷺ passed away and he was pleased with them - you dont worry about them

895
01:08:44,194 --> 01:08:46,094
because they have been through all the tests.

896
01:08:46,809 --> 01:08:52,580
And whatever happens after that, whether it's happened in the incidence of Al-Jammal(جمل) or between Ali(علي) and Muawiyyah(معاويه),

897
01:08:53,750 --> 01:08:57,054
when it's compared to the scale of their deeds it's irrelevant.

